$$P\(\\mathcal{B}\\vert \\mathcal{L}\) = P\(\\mathcal{L}\\cap \\mathcal{B}\)/P\(\\mathcal{L}\) = P\(\\mathcal{L}\\vert \\mathcal{B}\)P\(\\mathcal{B}\)/P\(\\mathcal{L}\)$$
