  3. 3.

For each such dataset, compute ![
$$\\hat{\\theta }_{i} = \\begin{array}{c} \\mbox{ argmax} \\\\ \\theta \\end{array} \\mathcal{L}\(\\theta;\\mathcal{D}\)$$
](A442674_1_En_9_Chapter_IEq34.gif).

  4. 4.

Obtain ![
$$c_{\\alpha }\(\\hat{\\theta }_{i}\)$$
